WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.748 --> 00:00:03.840
My new book,
How Not to Age,

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.136
is now available
for pre-order!

00:00:06.136 --> 00:00:08.400
If you plan on
buying a copy,

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.100
please do me the
favor of pre-ordering.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.320
All pre-orders count towards
the first-week sales,

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:16.920
which factor into the New York Times
Best Seller list calculations.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:20.160
So, the more pre-orders
How Not to Age receives,

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.440
the more likely
it’ll make the list,

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:26.640
which will help expose millions
to the message of healthy eating.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.700
In fact, the book lands
on December 5th—

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:33.720
perfect timing for holiday gifts
for everyone in your life

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:36.240
who you want to live long,
healthy lives.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:39.960
Please consider getting some of
your holiday shopping done early

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:42.655
by pre-ordering
a whole stack!

00:00:42.655 --> 00:00:45.000
And, of course,
as always,

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.176
all the proceeds I receive
from all of my books

00:00:47.176 --> 00:00:49.841
are donated
directly to charity.

